{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "058865d01a01b4a41ff516744138e8238464a45660a0e6a245eb7a86a8b95e65", "ja": "よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "请多多指教──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1007_mc", "source_sha256": "3a1bee6719a931f07594f78c7c11ce93042804415706e810851831ea2def468e", "ja": "さて、折しも卒業の季節という事で。\n今日のテーマは、「将来の夢」です！", "zh": "说起来，正值毕业的季节。\n今天的主题是“将来的梦想”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1008_mc", "source_sha256": "133af50726f761c9d20d64aad1c5690c0ee175d5da05b797df980d8ad94e7c15", "ja": "とはいえ、みなさんアイドルなので……\nもしかして、夢は叶ってしまっていますか？", "zh": "话虽如此，大家都是偶像……\n难道说，梦想已经实现了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "bc09b0864d5f991d234fc35c96895b07dac42fd718b6b22703b4cd03211e0323", "ja": "そうですね。アイドルになることが、\n「将来の夢」だった人もいると思います。", "zh": "是啊。我想，也有人曾经把成为偶像当作“将来的梦想”吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "7605383ed4fdb0083db6494ff82fbb247ce540d1b7bb111f86b621b9fd042ead", "ja": "私個人としては、企画やプロデュースにも興味が\nありますね！　近くで仕事を見ているせいかしら？", "zh": "就我个人而言，我也对企划和制作感兴趣呢！或许是因为一直在近距离看着这份工作吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "65211c941fbf66012aac55ebea687554e3ebca7ad3c1c839edd305fb64131edb", "ja": "律子さんプロデュース！？　それは気になる……！\nはいはーい、茜ちゃんにも一枚噛ませてほしいでーす！", "zh": "律子小姐亲自制作！？这可让人按捺不住了……！\n举手举手——，也让小茜掺一脚嘛——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "2cc0101adb76338c8bdae39f5e4b3e74354517b3be3b3d406c6ce596b11a8557", "ja": "律子さんと茜ちゃんの頭脳が組めば、\n大ヒットも間違いナシでは……！？", "zh": "律子和小茜的大脑要是联起手来，\n绝对能大卖特卖吧……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "40ccd632ffe1a4db6f5fcbcc830516ea9c153fa493c0d7422ebcf1d159e62418", "ja": "構わないけど……その場合、\n売上は茜個人のものにはならないわよ？", "zh": "我倒是无所谓……不过那样的话，销量可就不能算作茜个人的了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "ca2c02c02bc485d9352000d7fc139eff8ef9bb27f950a49ad06f9bc13b3a8cd4", "ja": "ニャんとッ！？", "zh": "什喵！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "e556ca488f342961693e5820a6b237da02b754c8df0b2643a8b7ab320bd59751", "ja": "まあでも、今はアイドルに全力投球中なので！\n引き続きよろしくお願いしますね！", "zh": "不过，我现在正在全力投入偶像工作！\n今后也请多指教了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1016_mc", "source_sha256": "8d593e6b15b72fcca2ac0bdd033ab2088ec648a94892dfaade0daee8a74b39a8", "ja": "なるほど、ありがとうございます！　秋月さん、\n野々原さんはプロデュースする側にも興味があると。", "zh": "原来如此，谢谢！秋月小姐，原来野野原小姐也对制作这一方感兴趣啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1017_mc", "source_sha256": "087185f046a5bb1259b4487848ccdf424b640df592a0993cbb9276148d9e9c07", "ja": "横山さん、百瀬さん、菊地さんはいかがですか？", "zh": "横山小姐、百濑小姐、菊地小姐觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "2a8b8a5fbadbc5fc13e63b27da3a42d0f917557b1329974373c7192de299e1e2", "ja": "私は、アイドルだけで十分です！　けどどうせなら、\nみんなが名前を知ってるアイドルになってたいなぁ。", "zh": "我觉得只当偶像就已经很满足了！不过既然如此，我还是想成为一个所有人都知道名字的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "75ab96995d0d8254250325fb9b8ac7e72264835066355de68c4f27d14b925b43", "ja": "そうねえ。やっぱりアイドルになったからには、\nトップを目指したいけど……。", "zh": "是啊。既然都当上偶像了，还是想以登上顶峰为目标……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "78143d71a4b5884ef25120c7a029cbcdb2a89fb30f9905daa9201dadc6b6ed2c", "ja": "私は『百瀬莉緒セルフプロデュース写真集』を出したい\nわね！　年間売り上げナンバーワンを狙うわよ、ウフ♪", "zh": "我想推出《百濑莉绪》呢！我要冲击年销量第一，嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "ea27f915c86ca207582d5159ec682904f39eccc0831879149dd9ccf773ea0415", "ja": "おお……！　さすがやな、莉緒！\nめっちゃアイドルらしい夢やん！", "zh": "哦……不愧是莉绪！\n真是个特别像偶像会有的梦想啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "1dca7bbfa788b6c414e25ed9501279c2310777a8e45e854fc14fbf547cc0ad29", "ja": "そうだよ、莉緒やん！\n何故、今までその可能性に気づかなかったのか……！", "zh": "就是啊，莉绪！\n为什么直到现在都没发现这个可能性……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "a655f3910953ee3536e3099ccfcdb92a3df63316cf919fb80c6dfc3141f4a324", "ja": "やだ、みんなそんなに褒めないで♪　照れるじゃない♪", "zh": "讨厌啦，大家别这么夸我嘛♪　人家会害羞的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1024_mc", "source_sha256": "8a91eacf8face57c12e49719ce717f0f000377868fdac4f6eb16f06a49bdebf8", "ja": "素敵な夢ですね！　菊地さんいかがですか？\n将来、どんな大人になりたいかなどでも構いませんよ！", "zh": "真是个美好的梦想呢！菊地小姐，您觉得怎么样？比如将来想成为怎样的大人之类的，也可以哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "38c8d4966610e5306bd45c40c713cf72d893ef4cbacb387de87bd94dc468e522", "ja": "え？　えっと、ボクは……。", "zh": "咦？那个，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1026_p", "source_sha256": "4d88d20b359d679c29d81e26e775f77277db7659b290554d2eed416e1aef8eb2", "ja": "（真……？）", "zh": "（真……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "1f42c3a0f72e468bef722958328f20b5b35366c4988d63715480579cce3e9029", "ja": "ボクは……いざという時に、大切な人を守れるような。\nそんな大人になりたいです！", "zh": "我想成为那种……在关键时刻，能够保护重要之人的大人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1028_audience", "source_sha256": "e159bc86ba6f8a0a6b365d05eb05a309544f1fffbf3ec5c5d0866d4da2475a4e", "ja": "キ……キャア～～～！！！", "zh": "好……呀啊啊啊——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1029_009rit", "source_sha256": "6abeb5bdf6c7251c1766aae94ed427c298ceb16d275dfeb2bb48d619fdaa45bf", "ja": "ええっ！？　ま、真！？", "zh": "诶！？真、真！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1030_mc", "source_sha256": "81900d3b6dc5b40af4b5be195ab201fb63b32cbf0873a49d2d0990b2e76c1c9c", "ja": "あら……♪", "zh": "哎呀……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1032_p", "source_sha256": "16882b778a16a7c0e07252d74add5a1d518b9fa53a5f3214a59a56d95a2516cc", "ja": "「765プロの王子様・菊地真ってどんな人？\n恋人は？　家族構成は？　調べてみました！」……。", "zh": "“765事务所的王子殿下·菊地真是个怎样的人？\n有恋人吗？家庭成员都有谁？我们调查了一下！”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1033_p", "source_sha256": "eab673e2184bf25632b06042a59fd39a182b4e03a95600bc2d77c6c9d692d9eb", "ja": "「イケメン女性アイドル菊地真！　大切な人って誰？」\n……う～ん、どれも似たような感じだな。", "zh": "“帅气女性偶像菊地真！重要的人到底是谁？”\n……唔～，感觉全都是这套说辞啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1034_006mak", "source_sha256": "4cefec4abef4c2e6129b63de5a06431ce2e3652c3036ff1087217becc079cdac", "ja": "す、すみません……。", "zh": "对、对不起……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1035_p", "source_sha256": "807195be803c84fdbd06e8d9147caa61fbb85c725eb6e8fd66505ab078629ca3", "ja": "いや、番組的には盛り上がったって感謝されたし、\nいいんだけど。真こそ、いいのか？", "zh": "没，我还因为让节目热闹起来而被感谢了，所以没关系。倒是阿真，你真的没事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1036_006mak", "source_sha256": "c30a90d6bc0d8faeb04d025dfa966090e085eba4699a98a2e5079a3815c00de7", "ja": "え、いいのかって……？", "zh": "诶，你问我没关系吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1037_p", "source_sha256": "520002d4e05e121626a510ffceee16d2528af4e51c140e307b4d5d9d5d6d384e", "ja": "こういうネット記事もだけど、イケメン扱いとか\n王子様扱いが増えそうだし……。", "zh": "不光是这种网络文章，对她以帅哥或王子殿下相称的情况也会增加吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1038_p", "source_sha256": "b2097776355ad97729a6e9af73fdeb07d66fcbe6a92469701d4614c8376643fa", "ja": "何より、真自身が心から王子様みたいな人に\nなりたいと思ってるって、誤解されちゃったかなって。", "zh": "最重要的是，我是不是被误会成真自己打心底里想成为王子般的人了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1039_006mak", "source_sha256": "df31e8d1b0dffaecc69a8787b0cd082135f5633a6d0d9ea08c363c6ed9bf4db2", "ja": "えっと……そのことなんですけど。", "zh": "呃……关于那件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1040_006mak", "source_sha256": "a24a9739d4f011ed2c942b19f1c92e863db42b0edc3736d9117cb9a0e6a0db6d", "ja": "正直言って、ボク、自分の将来について\nあまり想像がついてないっていうか……。", "zh": "老实说，我对自己的未来……不太能想象得到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1041_p", "source_sha256": "b29460c4caf4a2b845f7ca683dd699fd3594b3da6849e15571fcf503856e93e1", "ja": "そうなのか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1042_006mak", "source_sha256": "5580c95c2dfed00a60fa099d41def3de7eef0b05c928f4bd83e089027a0271ad", "ja": "はい。事前回答には、「歌もダンスもバッチリな\nトップアイドル！」……なんて書いちゃいましたけど。", "zh": "是的。我在事前问卷里写了“唱歌跳舞都无可挑剔的顶尖偶像！”……不过，彩排得还真不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1043_006mak", "source_sha256": "1f50188a48d0223138e17a89ecdf7598eaf1f010e30523842daaae1477d4de56", "ja": "でもそれって、あくまでアイドルとしての目標で。\n『どんな大人か』じゃないですよね。", "zh": "不过那终究只是作为偶像的目标。\n并不是在说“要成为怎样的大人”，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1044_p", "source_sha256": "5a9163df7233c0c3b70d5942def77c91d033bec5d3921542b1826c1fb73795d7", "ja": "気付いてたのか……。実は本番前にも、\nその事で話をしようと思ってたんだ。", "zh": "原来你已经注意到了啊……其实在正式演出前，我也正想谈谈那件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1045_p", "source_sha256": "d4e9744f60c92646a969af7f20998867f3bffef3240dc2a7b36fe1730fe8e14e", "ja": "夢の話で、それどころじゃなくなっちゃったけど。", "zh": "结果聊起梦的事，就顾不上那些了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1046_006mak", "source_sha256": "539d026e9422d5c8840a285c4ea5b86acf878ce47a510f0f692e4457ff6a9d11", "ja": "ええっ、そうだったんですか！？　すみません！\nそれなのにボク、ヘンな話しちゃって……。", "zh": "欸，原来是这样吗！？对不起！\n明明这样，我还说了些奇怪的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1047_006mak", "source_sha256": "8fa8884f42afc1ac7d48b9b09006b1667afb52bbd60a3300bbfdadf4ace49a61", "ja": "でもやっぱり、{$P$}は気付いて\nくれたんですね。ボクがモヤッとしてたこと……。", "zh": "不过果然还是被{$P$}注意到了呢。我一直觉得心里闷闷的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1048_p", "source_sha256": "0ca6c5fd288c564732ae0d61641a2a06dea99d782df9fa45f62db2bfb91f071f", "ja": "そりゃあ、真のプロデューサーだからな。\nでも、ちょっと意外だったよ。", "zh": "那当然，毕竟我是你的制作人嘛。  \n不过，还是有点意外啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1049_p", "source_sha256": "a13aef470ae50786279271a3778d402b9f0ef67bfe5c41b82a2b9c4ee22692f5", "ja": "真は可愛いもの、女性的な表現に憧れが強いから。\nてっきり、そういう回答が来るのかと思ってたのに。", "zh": "因为真很向往可爱的东西和女性化的表达。\n我还以为你肯定会给出那样的回答呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1050_006mak", "source_sha256": "60ba8b45ec4636d7eac0a7ca248441be48a0c8a88fc2c006f405dde5fafc4ea2", "ja": "それも正解です……もう、やんなっちゃうな。\n{$P$}には、隠し事ができないや。", "zh": "这个答案也对……真是的，真让人伤脑筋。\n在{$P$}先生面前，根本藏不住秘密啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1051_006mak", "source_sha256": "4274a1036db025a20fdad5a244b5ecf390f3cb15ed3c4beef5e11d60834fb218", "ja": "でも、なんだか嬉しくもありますね！　へへっ。", "zh": "不过，总觉得也有点开心呢！嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1052_p", "source_sha256": "ebb5b6b9976983e079007ed87f26edcd6d604438711b3bc56bfe06a0ae7e1170", "ja": "それなら良かった。プロデューサーとして、\nアイドルの一番の理解者ではありたいからな。", "zh": "那就好。作为制作人，我还是希望成为最理解偶像的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1053_006mak", "source_sha256": "6deb6922e8d9d8035656646dc4a50da8b6a9ffc9fbc65ba46bab5764194949d6", "ja": "十分です！　あ、でも……\nだから余計に、あの夢が怖かったのかも？", "zh": "这样就够了！啊，不过……\n也许正因为如此，才会觉得那个梦格外可怕吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1054_p", "source_sha256": "b36bdd53d2cd1df3a4247a3becebb16121309095a0bca733ba66a7630a145ffe", "ja": "怖かった……夢が？", "zh": "很害怕……那个梦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1055_006mak", "source_sha256": "e16ba812215a144912540428fb2473aee3846b59e487b105ade5c2233540b2d4", "ja": "はい。ボク、アイドルをしてることって、最初は\n家族……特に父さんには、内緒にしていたんですよね。", "zh": "是的。我一开始瞒着家里人……尤其是爸爸，偷偷做着偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1056_006mak", "source_sha256": "5799590edd6adaeb58a976753a68b9cf3c69d6dce3081c3eadd0bbfa3eb014e6", "ja": "流石に無理なので、今はもう話してありますけど。\nけどやっぱり、良く思われていないのかも……って。", "zh": "不过确实瞒不下去，所以现在已经告诉他们了。可是，我还是会想……他们或许并不太认可吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1057_p", "source_sha256": "e4fdba82449cb7f3ad590af3a993317ab00ce4149ce595111a0d13093d058f93", "ja": "そうか……。", "zh": "是吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1058_006mak", "source_sha256": "6ea2962468d699823c92d8a2e75bdb04ab840fbf47458716eb475e4c974be50d", "ja": "そういう意味でも、{$P$}は\nボクにとって、一番の理解者なんですよ！", "zh": "从这个意义上说，{$P$}也是最理解我的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1059_006mak", "source_sha256": "4dc2c9ecd6697f51e583be70a3cb900e0c45c9d7e65a46bfa12b2c29b84653df", "ja": "だから、そんな人がいなくなっちゃったら……なんて、\n想像するだけで怖くなっちゃって……。", "zh": "所以，要是那样的人不在了……光是想象一下，就觉得好害怕……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1060_p", "source_sha256": "ed7905d8497fb6ad24fb31e537c77f6796d6cc35fa3207bcbcf74e117a91c0c5", "ja": "ドラゴンとは戦えないから、あまり心配しないで\nほしいけど……真は、お父さんの事はどう思ってる？", "zh": "我又打不过龙，所以别太担心……不过，真，你是怎么看待你父亲的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1061_006mak", "source_sha256": "a2b542f5691f2efc9c12cf89d6ea3b6e9e86e98c2c0a031dd9562da5959f5db9", "ja": "父さんですか？　うーん。\n自分勝手な人だとは思いますけど……。", "zh": "是父亲吗？嗯——\n我觉得他是个很任性的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1062_006mak", "source_sha256": "0bdbb919acd13e1afbc84b49c5aedb0983b52873d7609c3e335a0a718ff6fae7", "ja": "でも、ボクが今のボクになったのって、\n父さんがきっかけなところもありますよね……。", "zh": "不过，我能成为现在的自己，也有一部分是因为父亲吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1063_006mak", "source_sha256": "9ee58809e4ea3cb1dc97cd0766dbdfd8ee762de727273284ad7870afd454ec08", "ja": "あっ、だからって感謝とかしてないですよ！？\n小さいころとか、すっごくイヤでしたし！", "zh": "啊，不过我可没有因此感谢他哦！？\n毕竟小时候真的特别讨厌他！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1064_006mak", "source_sha256": "4c3a08d44adf7fc835e019be4972260c1b5f7d4bbfc54226cf4f2b6ebf566a92", "ja": "でもこれも、今のボクだから言えることですね。\nどう思ってる……どう思ってるかぁ……。", "zh": "不过，这也是现在的我才能说出口的话。\n要说我是怎么想的……怎么想的啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1065_p", "source_sha256": "02778d6461d1bd66b1a4d30b92565f63dc623dcb576eb308191548555a4b0f38", "ja": "一言では難しいか。……それはきっと、\n真が大人になってきた証拠でもあるんだろうな。", "zh": "一句话概括确实很难啊。……这大概也是，真逐渐长大了的证明吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1066_006mak", "source_sha256": "00f6948ecfe6d9791540a7f6d3bc7b212daa1f423cf21a9b698b84ca344924e8", "ja": "えっ……そ、そうですか？", "zh": "诶……是、是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1067_p", "source_sha256": "14b227e12667f62011db1d57ec96f6d78470db7eaed01e50232b17ca47c58a50", "ja": "うん。いろんな思いがあっても、真は今の\n自分の魅力を活かして、アイドルをやってるだろ？", "zh": "嗯。就算心里有各种各样的想法，真还是在发挥自己如今的魅力，当偶像，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1068_p", "source_sha256": "27b84810e50050bb60cf0379c7cdd58874ae841f9fed3b459f427f98c727f0cb", "ja": "真がファンの人達に『理想の王子様』扱いされる事は、\n強い武器で……事務所の戦略でもあるしな。", "zh": "真被粉丝们当作“理想的王子殿下”，这是很强的武器……也是事务所的策略。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1069_006mak", "source_sha256": "2206c2cce59afdb34dce2d6124470b5f1630e271ff5cd1180a8a744c950bd7b3", "ja": "戦略なんて、そんな……。\nでも、これがボクですから！", "zh": "战略什么的，哪有……  \n不过，这就是我嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1070_006mak", "source_sha256": "72b19b6275ea779e6ed987bbdbfd28391649a2899447076d8816338b6360a012", "ja": "あるものは、使わないともったいないかな、って\n思ってます！", "zh": "我觉得，有现成的东西不用就太可惜了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1071_p", "source_sha256": "7f16e4f6cf9300149c0dd4231100ca2c0ab215ba77031ddcfd952c273c4616bb", "ja": "ありがとう。\n真が成人するまでは、もう少しあるけど……。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n虽然离真成年，还有一段时间就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1072_p", "source_sha256": "a4c30fee75f37cad43d86a982c907f96bd25cd0b34ab1c605f6dec7e70df7411", "ja": "でも真はもう、自分がどんな大人になりたいかを、\n好きに選ぶ事ができると思うよ。", "zh": "不过，真现在已经可以自由选择自己想成为怎样的大人了，我觉得。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1073_006mak", "source_sha256": "f261a932e0cc92a6ccec1147e1541d91f9fca27a29afde8e29c1653d33502e93", "ja": "ボクが、どんな大人になりたいか……。", "zh": "我想成为怎样的大人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1074_p", "source_sha256": "e93450bae757b450f080b54bf344f6c95b0bb3f7ae34b3f2d769df5bd5fed31f", "ja": "ちょうど、次は真の新曲公演を予定してるし。\n大人っぽい曲を歌ってみるのもいいかもしれないな。", "zh": "正好接下来安排了真演唱新歌的公演。试着唱唱成熟风格的歌曲，说不定也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1075_p", "source_sha256": "1aec1d2447881702bb8305f621bddfe1a9b38f92c586d7119999e7c382ab1fc0", "ja": "真も、リクエストがあったら言ってみてくれ。\n歌ってみたい曲調とか、テーマとか。", "zh": "真，要是你有什么想唱的曲风或主题，也尽管告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1076_006mak", "source_sha256": "4bfa98401338e89b32530dca570e0401d57d2943d44e617375e57f011a7d90b0", "ja": "大人っぽい曲……わかりました。\n大人……。", "zh": "成熟风格的曲子……我明白了。\n大人啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1077_006mak", "source_sha256": "aa69f6008fc3f50265c83dd1f4ca89883c819b658bc26b4bfbb223e738cd90ff", "ja": "ボクは……\nどんな大人になるのかな……。", "zh": "我……\n将来会成为怎样的大人呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1078_p", "source_sha256": "3a82a1e4182e8c56358366d3aeb03ba297de6a4ac9dff6e2bfe508739ea6c950", "ja": "（呟いた真の表情は、少しだけ物憂げだった。\n……やっぱり、前より大人になっている気がするな）", "zh": "（真喃喃自语时的表情，带着些许忧郁。……果然，感觉她比以前更成熟了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1080_006mak", "source_sha256": "322e9c4a28a35849fa1bf26f1eeaeead11fd1b83a8aa440ddde2a1c4bf9c3e9d", "ja": "ただいま～！　あ～、疲れた！\n母さん、今日の夕ご飯なに？", "zh": "我回来啦～！啊～，累死我了！\n妈妈，今天晚饭吃什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1081_makotonohaha", "source_sha256": "d480ea04b79d328f34006f5a322e812a2f306e2257f7195c007f15a7ef0d662b", "ja": "おかえりなさい真、遅かったのね。\n今日はからあげよ。", "zh": "欢迎回来，真，你回来得真晚。\n今天吃炸鸡块哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1082_006mak", "source_sha256": "d121d4a249519897751bb0d4dd98743d9277abd457d8b0425033f14b2e391844", "ja": "わぁっ、からあげなの！？　やーりぃ！", "zh": "哇，是炸鸡块吗！？太棒啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1083_makotonohaha", "source_sha256": "ccb71841638db075b27770d6ef178ae67ad3d298d92feed193414c6e92bc82b3", "ja": "ええ。真がお仕事頑張ってるから、\nからあげにしたらどうだってお父さんが。", "zh": "嗯。爸爸说，真最近工作这么努力，要不要做炸鸡块。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1084_006mak", "source_sha256": "ed60d34f0433b4fddb9490024dd58a9c9b7c74ccacecf25d6e9fcfb674f82a51", "ja": "へ、父さんが？　なんで？", "zh": "诶，爸爸？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1085_makotonohaha", "source_sha256": "88f83abf3b1c5cb338243aa9f1152ab1c6bcdda5f05e93c4f8836ffd175a34d4", "ja": "今日、音楽番組に出てたでしょ？\n歌とトークの。", "zh": "今天上音乐节目了吧？\n就是那个又唱歌又聊天的节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1086_006mak", "source_sha256": "20b17cb8d99b37ce467a389623b45855939dbba02b8829bb907ca589d688ab83", "ja": "あっ、うん……見てくれてたの？", "zh": "啊，嗯……你有看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1087_makotonohaha", "source_sha256": "3da1606cb9d18f26bbc627f8188ca6953a0ff854aec6df576b1d9e30c2167915", "ja": "ええ。真がテレビで言ったこと、\nお父さん嬉しかったみたい。", "zh": "嗯。真在电视上说的话，\n爸爸好像很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1088_makotonohaha", "source_sha256": "1094d57d6bf3b02f6e2e6918e56114541022684f1e4e0acce049921184314f84", "ja": "「大切な人を、守れるような大人」に……。", "zh": "成为“能够保护重要之人的大人”……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1089_makotonohaha", "source_sha256": "972f8895d827b96648afbbbd695963cd627a72d0eaebb606904bb0d8d73d1312", "ja": "お父さんが一番教えたかったこと、\n真はちゃんとわかってるなって言ってたわよ。", "zh": "他说，真真正明白了爸爸最想教给她的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1090_006mak", "source_sha256": "ebe2f4075cf6018e272799b6e3e3551ea8abeca8ed9bc14e3bfde84beda06871", "ja": "父さんが、そんなことを？\n……。", "zh": "爸爸他……想教我那种事？  \n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1091_makotonohaha", "source_sha256": "e4f49d577d67756ce07b4d0f874b3b6bd9431e5c454d760d9bc51a29814dc35f", "ja": "今お味噌汁あっため直してるから、座って。\n早く食べて、お風呂入っちゃいなさい。", "zh": "我现在正把味噌汤重新热上，坐下吧。\n快点吃，吃完就去洗澡。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1092_006mak", "source_sha256": "b928f8d7dc5f1cb7d85fc322133dcf2ef024704feaea32a11b8c1caa0596cf37", "ja": "あ、うん。\nありがとう。", "zh": "啊，好。\n谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1093_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1094_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1095_006mak", "source_sha256": "fe72798064a23aa1e5da013b1c274084f6eb2ba372693c8752ef4ce7f9ba7bba", "ja": "……{$P$}！\nあの、お願いがあるんです！", "zh": "……{$P$}！\n那个，我有事想拜托你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1096_p", "source_sha256": "030b02504455bcbe8ac6c64fae3e14abdc1d570ca809c8073ced1b8e5518df01", "ja": "お疲れ様、真。どうしたんだ？\nあ、身辺警護なら間に合ってるからな。", "zh": "辛苦了，真。怎么了？\n啊，要是说贴身护卫的话，就不用了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1097_006mak", "source_sha256": "65de26c7486c61ed159e0d2640d07dd6e381d1a22c68e7225dd2235985e248c1", "ja": "いえ、そうじゃなくて。今度、ボクの\n新曲を作ってもらう話がありましたよね？", "zh": "不是啦，不是那件事。之前不是提过，\n下次要帮我制作新歌的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1098_006mak", "source_sha256": "fe0920c9de6e8ec6127d44b2488876eb59ee59c7727120ff95a66da647e50e9b", "ja": "ボク、歌ってみたい内容があるっていうか……\nその、上手く言えないんですけど。", "zh": "我有想尝试唱的内容……该怎么说呢，那个，我也说不太清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_142_1099_p", "source_sha256": "582d62637c3690ccc680db89e9f6c0699c816141a9921c6bba670486ef05d744", "ja": "そうか。別に、上手く言えなくてもいいぞ。\n真の歌いたい曲の話、聞かせてくれ！", "zh": "这样啊。没关系，不用非得说清楚。\n把你想唱的歌告诉我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
